          "text": "Description: On March 4, 2000, around 11:15 PM, a couple observed, twice with a 10-minute interval, a round object of white-yellow color moving at 15-20 meters altitude. At the end of its trajectory, a small noise accompanied by a green light was heard. No noise was detected. The observed phenomenon could be mistaken for a rotating beacon, but the available information does not allow for a serious analysis.",
